Root cause:
The bug was caused by a regression introduced in a previous commit that altered the order of operations in the `drm_mode_getconnector` function. This change resulted in the user space receiving an updated mode list without the corresponding updated property values, leading to inconsistencies in the data returned to userspace applications. The patch fixes this by ensuring that properties are retrieved after the modes are processed, thus reflecting the latest status of the connector.
